@host = http://localhost:8080


### 1. 회원가입
POST {{host}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jioh035@kakao.com",
  "password": "12341234",
  "name": "일반회원"
}


### 2. 중복 이메일 회원가입
### → 409 Conflict 예상
POST {{host}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@test.com",
  "password": "12341234",
  "name": "중복회원"
}


### 3. 로그인
### → 응답의 Authorization JWT 복사
POST {{host}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@test.com",
  "password": "12341234"
}


### 4. JWT 변수
### → 위 로그인 응답의 JWT를 여기에 넣기
@userToken =eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIyIiwiZW1haWwiOiJ1c2VyMkB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsIm5hbWUiOiLsnbzrsJjtmozsm5AiLCJyb2xlIjoiUk9MRV9VU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzg5MzEyMDY1LCJleHAiOjE3ODkzMTU2NjV9.PUBXQFa6r0zN1iduAXnGAEHseIXU8ALrOaOWBUYn5JA

### ========================================
### 5. 내 정보 조회
### → 200 OK 예상
### ========================================

GET {{host}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ========================================
### 6. JWT 없이 내 정보 조회
### → 401 Unauthorized 예상
### ========================================

GET {{host}}/members/me


### ========================================
### 7. 잘못된 Authorization 형식
### → 401 Unauthorized 예상
### ========================================

GET {{host}}/members/me
Authorization: Basic abcdefg


### ========================================
### 8. 잘못된 JWT
### → 401 Unauthorized 예상
### ========================================

GET {{host}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.jwt.token


### ========================================
### 9. 비밀번호 변경
### → 200 OK 예상
### ========================================

PUT {{host}}/members/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "12341234",
  "newPassword": "56785678"
}


### ========================================
### 10. 변경한 비밀번호로 로그인
### → 200 OK 예상
### ========================================

POST {{host}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@test.com",
  "password": "56785678"
}


### ========================================
### 11. 기존 비밀번호 로그인
### → 실패 예상
### ========================================

POST {{host}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@test.com",
  "password": "12341234"
}


### ========================================
### 12. 회원 탈퇴
### → 200 OK 예상
### ========================================

DELETE {{host}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "56785678"
}


### ========================================
### 13. 탈퇴 후 내 정보 조회
### → 실패 예상
### ========================================

GET {{host}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ========================================
### 14. 탈퇴 후 로그인
### → 실패 예상
### ========================================

POST {{host}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@test.com",
  "password": "567865678"
}


### ========================================
### OAuth2
### ========================================

### 15. Kakao 로그인 시작
### 브라우저에서 실행
### http://localhost:8080/oauth2/authorization/kakao

### 16. Kakao 로그인 후 확인
### - 기존 LOCAL 회원과 같은 이메일이면
###   provider = KAKAO
###   providerId = Kakao ID
###   password = null
### - 새로운 이메일이면 Kakao 회원 신규 생성
